#: kubrick.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Rubik's Cube can be moved into many interesting patterns.  Here are a few "
"from David Singmaster's classic book 'Notes on Rubik's Magic Cube, Fifth "
"Edition', pages 47-49, published in 1981.  After a pattern has formed, you "
"can use the Solve action (default key S) to undo and redo it as often as you "
"like."
msgstr ""
"Rubik sien Wunnerwörpel lett sik na vele intressante Mustern verdreihen. "
"Hier en poor ut David Singmeister sien Book \"Notes on Rubik's Magic Cube\", "
"föffte Utgaav, Siet 47-49, rutgeven 1981. Wenn en Muster opstellt wöör, "
"kannst Du de Akschoon \"Lösen\" (Standardtast \"S\") bruken, un dat as faken "
"as Du wullt torüchnehmen un wedderhalen."

